<title>USA: Foundation Health backs $2.20 1997 EPS.</title>
<headline>Foundation Health backs $2.20 1997 EPS.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foundation Health Systems Inc said on Thursday it was comfortable with a $2.20 per share earnings estimate for 1997.</p>
<p>David Olson, vice president of investor relations at Foundation Health, told a Dillon Read analysts meeting that 1997 was going to be a very critical year for the company as it integrated its operations with its merger partner Health Systems International Inc.</p>
<p>&quot;We must integrate the two companies, which we intend to do by year end,&quot; Olson said. &quot;The process is well under way in California...We must also strengthen our balance sheet.&quot;</p>
</text>
